  "note": "Static inventory. Expands two literal ambient actions and imported relay constant. Excludes Fastify automatic HEAD aliases; binary HEAD routes explicitly included. No route handler was invoked. Updated by explicit review for the eight previously installed durable execution/fence routes and the new reversible source-disable route; baseline revision precedes the latter. Task05.2 explicitly adds the country-only server preflight route; parser, paging and metadata changes retain existing route identities. Merge review explicitly retains the installed Overture recovery inspection and main read-only transit pin inspection; no additional mutation is admitted. Recovery review adds the service-auth generation-hardlinks non-admission attestation route; it observes the original canceled expired grant and locked receiver state, without admitting or replaying a job. Application maintenance recovery adds its service-auth non-admission route for the original canceled expired preparation, requiring locked SQL and original private adoption evidence; it never admits or replays PREPARE. Removal review drops the nine uncalled NDJSON progress routes and the uncalled font download route; their job kinds remain admitted only through durable executions.",
